---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

---
<Base title="Security & Data Protection" description="Your data stays yours: encrypted, isolated in your own environment, hosted in the US, and never used to train AI for others without your written opt-in." current="security">
<section aria-labelledby="h1" style="padding:clamp(32px,4vw,48px) 0 clamp(40px,5vw,72px)">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:clamp(32px,5vw,64px)"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#585E5A">chevron_right</span><span aria-current="page" style="color:#585E5A">Security &amp; Trust</span></nav>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,420px),1fr));gap:clamp(40px,6vw,80px);align-items:end">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">Security &amp; Trust</p>
<h1 id="h1" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,48px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.025em">Security and data protection</h1>
<p style="font-size:clamp(18px,1.6vw,20px);line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;max-width:56ch">Your data stays yours: encrypted, isolated in your own environment, hosted in the US, and never used to train AI for others without your written opt-in.</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:8px">
<a class="x1" href="/book-a-discovery-call?topic=security" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:52px;padding:0 28px;border-radius:999px;background:#0F4C45;color:#FAF7F2;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none">Request a security review</a>
<a class="x2" href="#it" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:52px;padding:0 28px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid #0F4C45;color:#0F4C45;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none">Questions your IT team may ask</a>
</div>
<p style="font-size:14px;color:#585E5A">Last updated October 2026</p>
</div>
<ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px">
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">lock</span><b style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4">Encrypted in transit and at rest</b></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">deployed_code</span><b style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4">Your own isolated environment</b></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">cloud_done</span><b style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4">Hosted on US servers</b></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">notifications_active</span><b style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.4">Incident notice within 72 hours</b></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<div class="sec-cols" style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px) clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px);display:grid;gap:64px;align-items:start">
<nav class="hide-lt1100" aria-label="On this page" style="position:sticky;top:96px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;font-size:15px;padding-top:8px">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A;margin-bottom:12px">On this page</p>
<a class="x3" href="#data" style="padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:#1A211F;text-decoration:none">Data protection</a>
<a class="x4" href="#access" style="padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:#1A211F;text-decoration:none">Access</a>
<a class="x5" href="#ai" style="padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:#1A211F;text-decoration:none">AI governance</a>
<a class="x6" href="#calls" style="padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:#1A211F;text-decoration:none">Calls and messages</a>
<a class="x7" href="#incident" style="padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:#1A211F;text-decoration:none">If something goes wrong</a>
<a class="x8" href="#exit" style="padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:#1A211F;text-decoration:none">Your data, your exit</a>
<a class="x9" href="#hosting" style="padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:#1A211F;text-decoration:none">Hosting options</a>
<a class="x10" href="#providers" style="padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:#1A211F;text-decoration:none">Providers &amp; certifications</a>
<a class="x11" href="#it" style="padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:#1A211F;text-decoration:none">Questions from IT</a>
</nav>

<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:clamp(64px,8vw,96px);min-width:0">

<section id="data" aria-labelledby="data-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px">
<h2 id="data-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,32px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Data protection</h2>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:16px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">lock</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3">Encryption</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Your data is encrypted while it travels (TLS) and while it's stored (AES-256).</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">cloud_done</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3">Hosting</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Managed hosting on AWS in the United States, where client data stays on US servers.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">deployed_code</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3">Isolation</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">You get your own isolated environment, enforced at the database level. No other client can reach it.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">backup</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3">Backups and monitoring</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Regular backups stored separately, continuous monitoring, and maintenance included.</p></div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="access" aria-labelledby="access-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px">
<h2 id="access-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,32px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Access</h2>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:16px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">badge</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3">Role-based access</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Each person sees only what their role allows. Access is permission-scoped and enforced by the system.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">handshake</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3">Support access with consent</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Our team accesses your environment only for technical support, and only with your consent.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;grid-column:1/-1"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">history</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3">Audit trail</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;max-width:68ch">Consequential actions are logged: who, when, what changed and what approval was given. The log is available to you. Data-integrity and access controls are built into the architecture and reviewed by our platform team.</p></div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="ai" aria-labelledby="ai-h" style="background:#0F4C45;color:#FAF7F2;border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(28px,4vw,48px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px">
<h2 id="ai-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,32px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">AI governance</h2>
<ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">menu_book</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">The AI answers only from your approved knowledge base. It gives no open-internet answers.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">how_to_reg</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">Consequential actions need human approval.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">support_agent</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">When the AI is unsure, it says so and routes to a person. Sensitive questions, for example medical or legal, go to a person you designate.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">block</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">Your data is never used to train models for others without your written opt-in.</p></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section id="calls" aria-labelledby="calls-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px">
<h2 id="calls-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,32px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Calls and messages</h2>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:16px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">dialpad</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3">Your own number</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">A dedicated number per client. Recordings and transcripts stay in your environment.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">phone_callback</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3">No unsolicited outreach</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">No unsolicited outbound calls or messages. All automated communication follows workflows you approve.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">verified_user</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3">Consent and disclosure</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We configure consent and disclosure settings. You maintain consents with your own contacts.</p></div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="incident" aria-labelledby="inc-h" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:24px;align-items:center;padding:clamp(28px,4vw,40px);background:#F0EAE0;border-radius:16px">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><h2 id="inc-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,32px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">If something goes wrong</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We notify you without undue delay, and no later than 72 hours after we're notified of a confirmed incident.</p></div>
<ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><li style="display:flex;gap:12px;padding:16px 20px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;font-size:16px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:22px;color:#0F4C45">info</span>What happened</li><li style="display:flex;gap:12px;padding:16px 20px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;font-size:16px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:22px;color:#0F4C45">dataset</span>What data was affected</li><li style="display:flex;gap:12px;padding:16px 20px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;font-size:16px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:22px;color:#0F4C45">build</span>The steps we're taking to fix it</li></ul>
</section>

<section id="exit" aria-labelledby="exit-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px">
<h2 id="exit-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,32px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Your data, your exit</h2>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:16px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">key</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3">You own your data</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We take no revenue share and make no claim on your data.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">download</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3">Full export when you leave</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">You get a full, machine-readable export within a 90-day window after you leave.</p></div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="hosting" aria-labelledby="host-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><h2 id="host-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,32px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Hosting options</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;max-width:64ch">Choose where your data lives.</p></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:16px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #0F4C45;border-radius:16px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:32px;color:#0F4C45">cloud</span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:28px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:999px;background:#E3EDE9;color:#0F4C45;font-weight:600;font-size:13px">Standard</span></div><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3">Our managed AWS hosting in the US</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Your own isolated environment on US servers, with monitoring, backups and maintenance included.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:16px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:32px;color:#0F4C45">dns</span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:28px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:999px;background:#F0EAE0;color:#585E5A;font-weight:600;font-size:13px">Scoped separately</span></div><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3">Bring your own server</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Keep your data on your own server. Responsibilities for that server are agreed in writing.</p></div>
</div>
<p style="display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px">info</span>The monitoring, backups and maintenance described on this page apply to managed hosting.</p>
</section>

<section id="providers" aria-labelledby="prov-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px">
<h2 id="prov-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,32px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Providers and certifications</h2>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:16px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3">Our providers</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Our core providers include AWS (hosting), Twilio (voice and messaging) and Anthropic (AI models). The full subprocessor list is in our Data Processing Agreement. We never sell or share data for marketing.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3">Certifications</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We don't hold SOC 2 or ISO 27001 today. We'll pursue formal certification when client requirements call for it. We will never claim a certification we don't hold.</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #DED5C6">Work involving health information is scoped separately (HIPAA) before any health data is processed.</p></div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="it" aria-labelledby="it-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px">
<h2 id="it-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,32px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Questions your IT team may ask</h2>
<div style="border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6">
<details open="" style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x12" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4">Where is our data stored?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 22px;max-width:64ch">With our managed hosting, on AWS in the United States, and it stays on US servers. If you choose to host on your own server, it stays there.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x13" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4">How is our data encrypted?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 22px;max-width:64ch">With TLS in transit and AES-256 at rest.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x14" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4">Can another client see our data?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 22px;max-width:64ch">No. Every client has its own isolated environment, enforced at the database level.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x15" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4">Who at HazirMinds can access our data?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 22px;max-width:64ch">Our platform team has access only for technical support, and only with your prior consent. Inside your organization, access is role-based and enforced by the system.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x16" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4">Are AI and admin actions logged?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 22px;max-width:64ch">Yes. Consequential actions are logged with who, when, what changed and what approval was given, and the log is available to you.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x17" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4">Is our data used to train AI models?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 22px;max-width:64ch">Not for others. Your data is never used to train models for other customers without your written opt-in.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x18" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4">What happens if there's a security incident?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 22px;max-width:64ch">We notify you without undue delay, and no later than 72 hours after we're notified of a confirmed incident, with what happened, what data was affected and the remediation steps.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x19" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4">Which subprocessors do you use?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 22px;max-width:64ch">Our core providers include AWS (hosting), Twilio (voice and messaging) and Anthropic (AI models). The full subprocessor list is in our Data Processing Agreement. We never sell or share data for marketing.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x20" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4">Do you have SOC 2 or ISO 27001?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 22px;max-width:64ch">We don't hold SOC 2 or ISO 27001 today. We'll pursue formal certification when client requirements call for it. We will never claim a certification we don't hold.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x21" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:22px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4">Do you handle health information?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 22px;max-width:64ch">Work involving health information is scoped separately (HIPAA) before any health data is processed.</p></details>
</div>
